        <nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#capabilities">Services</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#notes">Notes</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="mailto:hello@harkingbade.com">Start a conversation</a></nav>
      </details>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="hero-grid shell">
          <div class="hero-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Product / brand / growth / build</p><h1>Make the next useful move <span>visible.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">Harkingbade brings product, brand, content, growth, and build thinking together for people making something worth choosing.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button--accent" href="#capabilities">See the practice <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#work">View placeholder work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
          <div class="signal-panel reveal" aria-label="Animated Harkingbade signal visual"><div class="signal-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="signal-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="signal-core"><span>INPUT</span><strong>an unfinished idea</strong><i>→</i><span>OUTPUT</span><strong>a clearer next move</strong></div><div class="signal-caption">A practical operator's view</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-footer shell"><span>Independent practice</span><span>Canada / remote</span><span>Built to learn</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="capabilities"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What can move</p><h2>One practice. Several useful angles.</h2><p>Not a list of disconnected skills. A connected way to turn a problem into a clearer experience and a better next action.</p></div><div class="capability-list">{capabilities.map((item) => <article class="capability reveal"><span class="item-number">{item.number}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p><span class="item-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>)}</div></div></section>

      <section class="section section-dark" id="about"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The useful tension</p><h2>Good work lives between disciplines.</h2><p>Product decisions affect the story. The story affects the journey. The journey affects the result. Harkingbade works across those seams.</p></div><div class="situation-list">{situations.map((item) => <article class="situation reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">{item.label}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3></div><p><span>→</span>{item.answer}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>

      <section class="section" id="work"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2>Proof will live here.</h2><p>The evidence library is being rebuilt. These placeholders reserve space for honest case studies, experiments, and builds.</p></div><div class="work-grid">{placeholders.map((item) => <article class="work-card reveal"><div class="work-card-top"><span>{item.index}</span><span>Placeholder case study</span></div><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></div><a href="mailto:hello@harkingbade.com" aria-label={`Ask about ${item.title}`}>Reserve this space <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</div></div></section>

      <section class="section method-section" id="notes"><div class="shell"><div class="method-layout"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Working method</p><h2>Notice. Shape. Ship. Learn.</h2><p>A simple loop for work that has to make sense in the real world.</p></div><ol class="method-list">{method.map((item) => <li class="method-item reveal"><span>{item.index}</span><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol></div></div></section>

      <section class="section lab-section"><div class="shell lab-grid"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The lab</p><h2>Make the range tangible.</h2><p>Interactive prototypes, motion systems, AI-assisted workflows, ecommerce experiments, and web tools belong in the practice when they help the idea land.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@harkingbade.com">Talk through an experiment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="lab-visual reveal"><div class="lab-line line-a"></div><div class="lab-line line-b"></div><div class="lab-node node-a">idea</div><div class="lab-node node-b">system</div><div class="lab-node node-c">signal</div><span class="lab-label">prototype / test / learn</span></div></div></section>

      <section class="closing"><div class="shell closing-inner reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Start with context</p><h2>Bring one useful question.</h2><a class="button button--dark" href="mailto:hello@harkingbade.com">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell footer-inner"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Harkingbade</span><span>Product, brand, growth, and build</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('motion-ready');
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => entries.forEach((entry) => { if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('is-visible'); }), { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((element) => observer.observe(element));
</script>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; color: #171817; background: #f3f4ef; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; }
  :global(body::selection) { color: #f3f4ef; background: #171817; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; }
  :global(:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #ff5b36; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .shell { width: min(calc(100% - 3rem), 82rem); margin: 0 auto; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; z-index: 20; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; padding: .7rem 1rem; color: #fff; background: #171817; transform: translateY(-180%); }
  .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
  .site-header { position: sticky; z-index: 10; top: 0; display: grid; width: 100%; min-height: 4.75rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(23 24 23 / .15); background: rgb(243 244 239 / .88); backdrop-filter: blur(18px); }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-decoration: none; }
  .brand-mark { display: grid; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; place-items: center; color: #f3f4ef; background: #171817; font-size: 1rem; }
  .desktop-nav { display: flex; gap: 1.4rem; align-items: center; }
  .desktop-nav a, .header-cta { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .desktop-nav a { color: #666a65; }
  .desktop-nav a:hover { color: #171817; }
  .header-cta { justify-self: end; }
  .header-cta span, .text-link span, .item-arrow { color: #ff5b36; }
  .mobile-nav { display: none; justify-self: end; }
  .mobile-nav summary { padding: .45rem .75rem; border: 1px solid #171817; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .mobile-nav summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .mobile-nav nav { position: absolute; top: 100%; right: 0; left: 0; display: grid; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #171817; background: #f3f4ef; }
  .mobile-nav nav a { padding: .8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(23 24 23 / .15); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .hero { min-height: min(52rem, 90vh); padding: 7rem 0 2rem; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; min-height: 38rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(20rem, .95fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem); align-items: center; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 48rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #6b6e69; font-family: monospace; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
  h1, h2, h3 { letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: .95; }
  h1 { max-width: 10ch; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: clamp(4rem, 9.5vw, 9.6rem); font-weight: 800; }
  h1 span { color: #ff5b36; }
  h2 { max-width: 11ch; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.7rem); font-weight: 800; }
  h3 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.2vw, 2rem); }
  p { max-width: 36rem; }
  .hero-lede { max-width: 31rem; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; color: #5f635d; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem); }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: center; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 3.1rem; padding: .85rem 1.2rem; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; border: 1px solid #171817; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 160ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1), background-color 160ms ease-out, color 160ms ease-out; }
  .button:active { transform: scale(.97); }
  .button--accent { border-color: #ff5b36; background: #ff5b36; }
  .button--dark { color: #f3f4ef; background: #171817; }
